                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "PEAK Minter, no other shooter comes this close to audio and visual psychedelia and no drugs were taken during the course of any playthrough, I swear.  I have been a lifelong Minter fan, I used to buy games from his mother via mail order a very long time ago and played everything the great man has ever produced so it goes to say that T4000 is without exception, and so far, the best game from his quirky gaming stable.  11/10.",
